Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:44:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show the official apply portal in the action plan when
 eligible

- New engine/officialPortal.js: link printed in the notification, else a
  short checked list of official portals (PM-KISAN, AP pensions,
  Jnanabhumi, NSP), else a myScheme search with the scheme name.
- Action plan adds the apply step only when the citizen is eligible;
  the Do I qualify? result no longer shows an apply link.
- ApplyPortal component shows where the link came from (EN/TE/HI).
- Tests for the portal choice and the eligibility response.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AdxZA8ake6v51tkR6UMAdt
